				<title>Operational Staff Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-264760/scp-5308-j#post-4784832</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2020 00:28:52 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>N_Aepic_Fael</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4463776</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The images of the cube and the pen could not be sourced reliably and are assumed not compliant with CC 3.0. As such, they have been removed.</p> <p>The new image of the pen is by <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/emil_kabanov/6254839660/">Emil .</a> , under CC BY-SA 2.0.</p> <p>Image of the cat is user-owned, and Licensing consensus is that the new image of Jerry is indeed compliant due to WebArchive metadata.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
