				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>So I realized I've been commenting way too often in all these SCP discussions. Want me to turn it down a bit? I could try keep to feedback and ideas.</p> </blockquote> <p>Generally, it's good to be contributing to discussions rather than just throwing out &quot;lol [random statement/jokey post]&quot; comments. Those tend to get spammy after they're posted too often. Feedback and ideas are good, but you're fine so long as you're posting something that other people can talk about beyond &quot;uhh no, that was weird&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
